 "_notes": "Wounds that build up over a fight (WoundSystem.cs / WoundDecals.cs / WoundTable.cs). Rows are keyed by roster character id; \"*\" is the default row any character without its own row gets (a new character such as Joan needs no row). Rows are standalone: copy the \"*\" row and change what differs. decals: a DecalProjector per landed hit on the body at the hit height, aligned to the swing (slash = tilted horizontal streak, stab = round puncture, overhead = vertical streak), parented to the nearest bone, maxDecals per fighter then the oldest fades over fadeOutSec. stages: lowest hpFrac that HP is below wins; moveMul = limp, regenMul = breathing (stamina regen), guardRaiseExtraTicks = slower guard raise, guardLayerMul = guard arm sag (upper-body guard layer weight), dripEverySec = blood drips on the ground (BloodGround). legSlowSec/legSlowMul = V3 leg-hit slow. staminaCeilPerWound/staminaCeilMin = stamina ceiling lost per landed hit (fraction of max). vignette = player-only low-HP screen-edge blood (enabled false = off). Textures are generated in code (needs real textures later). Set enabled false for a hard off.",
